
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Moijj Music</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #100d1c;
      color: white;
    }
    header {
      background: #21163b;
      padding: 22px 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 { color: #c4a5ff; }
    main {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 25px auto;
      padding: 15px;
    }
    .song {
      background: #241c38;
      padding: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    button, .download {
      background: #a678ff;
      color: #100d1c;
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 15px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 5px 3px 0 0;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #bbb;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🎵 Moijj Music</h1>
    <p>Discover and enjoy new music</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h2>Latest Songs</h2>

    <div class="song">
      <h3>My First Song</h3>
      <p>Artist: Moijj</p>
      <audio controls preload="none" style="width:100%">
        <source src="songs/song1.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
      </audio>
      <br>
      <a class="download" href="songs/song1.mp3" download>
        ⬇ Download Song
      </a>
    </div>

    <p>More songs coming soon!</p>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Moijj Music</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

